 <div class="ch-txt sub refl"><p class="lab">Reflection</p><h3>Clarity beats cleverness.</h3><p>As a senior designer on this project, I learned that clarity beats cleverness. In a government context, users don’t want to be “delighted” by animations. They want to get their tasks done so they can get back to their lives.</p></div>
